{{Quote|''{{Green|You have awoken the Deep Sea Protector, prepare for a battle!}}''}}
The '''Deep Sea Protector''' is an {{Epic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up after unlocking {{Skill|Fishing|XVIII}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Deep Sea Protector''' can be fished up from any water source with a Water [[Fishing Rods|Fishing Rod]] if the player has {{Skill|Fishing|XVIII}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Deep Sea Protector''' is {{Green|88}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|2.05%|1|48.82|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
